      "paperId": "0dcd15a2d5a1ae25bd001e83c72b96301a3af286",
      "title": "\u201cAll of our lives have been terribly shaped by what went on before us\u201d: History and (Post)memory in Michael Ondaatje\u2019s Running in the Family and Anil\u2019s Ghost",
      "authors": [
